   <item>
    <widget class="QLabel" name="label">
     <property name="text">
      <string>The Grid is a visual pattern of lines or dots that acts as a digital sheet of graph paper. It provides draftspersons with a sense of scale, distance, and alignment directly in the drawing area. 
Meta-Grid group the background grid into distinct, readable blocks. It acts exactly like the major divisions on engineering graph paper to provide immediate spatial awareness, allowing to quickly judge large distances and scale without manually measuring.
When paired with Grid Snap, it locks the cursor to precise increments for fast, accurate drafting.
</string>
